            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "With default insert tab characters (`'\\t'`) are [expanded according to the buffer \"rules'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-snippets.txt#L1006). So my suggestion would be to always use tabs instead of hardcoded spaces.",
