        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Inserting `\\t` in multiple places within the snippet reduces its readability. Could you implement a feature that allows users to indent each level with 2 spaces? You can automatically adjust the indentation when the snippet has been expanded based on the buffer settings, such as using tabs or 4 spaces instead of 2.",
